  "caveats": [
    "Iowa SOS publishes 99 county-linked 2020 General precinct-result workbooks and a certified canvass, but this retained diagnostic has no immutable November 3, 2020 statewide or complete county GIS boundary artifact and no retained workbook bodies from which President identities, zero-vote rows, and non-geographic units can be independently counted. The SOS statewide precinct archive is expressly dated April 17, 2014, while SOS states that post-2020-census city and county precinct boundaries became effective January 15, 2022; neither is used for 2020 geometry. No result identity, geometry, crosswalk, or vote assignment is approved.",
    "The 2024 Iowa packages and their geometry, identifiers, names, counts, and crosswalk decisions are not reused.",
    "Target geometry, result-unit, and crosswalk metrics remain zero; delivery is null."
  ]
